== Dangers ==

Many mobs roam the zone at sow speeds, including some bosses. Evil players are strongly advised not to visit the zone alone. Good and neutral aligned players should be completely safe until they damage their faction by killing NPCs here.

== Benefits ==

The Plane of Growth is an open, outdoor raid zone similar to Plane of Fear. Armor sets drop for most classes with similar stats to Thurgadin Armor Quest gear. There are several mini-bosses with an increased chance to drop chest-slot armor, and Tunare herself, who drops some of the best weapons in the game.

== Traveling To and From ==

The entrance to PoG is found in [[The Wakening Land]] at the top of a tower in the middle of a lake located at 500, -1000. The portal looks like a large mushroom, planted in the roof of the building. No key is required but the traveler must be level 46+.

There is no way to exit PoG except via gate or other port.

